OL,3,GNEWSAChildhood obesity levels 'still
OL,4,Ahigher than hoped'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildhood obesity levels are "still
OL,7,Fmuch higher" than health leaders "would
OL,8,Flike" despite having "plateaued" in
OL,9,Frecent years, Public Health Jersey has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe latest data on children's height
OL,13,Fand weight showed one in four reception
OL,14,Fclass age children and one in three
OL,15,FYear 6 children were classified as
OL,16,Foverweight.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
