OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.* %%** %%**,$-, *(,% ,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAChildhood obesity levels 'still
OL,4,Ahigher than hoped'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead of Health Improvement Martin
OL,7,FKnight said tackling the problem
OL,8,Frequired a "holistic approach" and
OL,9,F"prevention first" initiatives. Jersey
OL,10,FSport said services "must ensure every
OL,11,Fyoung person has an accessible,
OL,12,Finclusive path to a healthy life,
OL,13,Fregardless of financial or personal
OL,14,Fhurdles".
OL,16,FThe BBC has contacted ministers for a
OL,17,Fresponse.
